  {"id":"tam_Taml-2","lang":"ta","dir":"ltr","langName":"Tamil","text":"அமேசான் நதி பூமியின் இரண்டாவது மிக நீளமான மற்றும் மிகப்பெரிய நதியாகும்.","pairs":["in_tam>us","in_tam99>us"],"source":{"kind":"belebele","dataset":"Belebele","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","flores":"tam_Taml","link":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikijunior:South_America/The_Amazon","question_number":1,"excerpt":"first sentence of the passage"}},
